<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MagneTek upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MagneTek upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded MagneTek Inc to buy from outperform, saying its fiscal third quarter earnings beat expectations.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Management-led turnaround continues&quot; at the company, a Lehman summary report said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 15-5/8.</p>
</text>
